            "summary": "CP/M 2.2 z RAM disku ZRMD-1 s hodinami reálného času RTC-1, sériovou deskou DSP-1 a programy J. Bíby. Po zapnutí stiskněte 3; E:RTCZ ukáže hodiny (ESC konec), DOPCP SOUBOR pošle soubor XMODEMem do okna terminálu.",
            "summary_en": "CP/M 2.2 from the ZRMD-1 RAM disk with the RTC-1 real-time clock, the DSP-1 serial board and J. Bíba's programs. After power on press 3; E:RTCZ shows the clock (ESC ends), DOPCP FILE sends a file by XMODEM to the terminal window."
        },
        "cpm_and30c.sapi": {
            "title": "CP/M s displejem 80 znaků AND-30C",
            "title_en": "CP/M with the 80-column display AND-30C",
            "name_en": "CP/M 2.2 with the 80-column display AND-30C (JPR-1ZI ECMON, DMR-1, AND-30C, ZRMD-1)",
            "summary": "Displej AND-30C (MC6845, 80 × 21 znaků) ze sestavy SAPI-IPS, emulovaný podle schématu ze zpětného inženýrství (P. Všijanský). Software k němu se nedochoval, ovladač v ECMONu je napsaný nově. Po zapnutí stiskněte 3, pak DIR. Při zápisu do obrazovky deska obraz krátce zatemní, jako skutečná.",
            "summary_en": "The display AND-30C (MC6845, 80 × 21 characters) of the set SAPI-IPS, emulated after the schematic redrawn by reverse engineering (P. Všijanský). No software for it survives, the driver in ECMON is new. After power on press 3, then DIR. When the screen is written the card blanks the picture for a moment, as the real one does."
        },
        "cpm_ec1045.sapi": {
            "title": "CP/M EC1045 s disketami 3,5\" a 5,25\" HD",
            "title_en": "CP/M EC1045 with 3.5\" and 5.25\" HD floppies",
            "name_en": "CP/M 2.2 EC1045: RAM disk + FDC-1 with 3.5\"/5.25\" HD (ECMON_cd, BIOS ECBIF3/F5)",
            "summary": "Systém EC1045 (Petr Všijanský): CP/M z RAM disku ZRMD-1 a řadič FDC-1 s disketami PC 3,5\" a 5,25\" HD. Po zapnutí stiskněte 1 (3,5\") nebo 2 (5,25\", disketu vložte v okně Média), pak DIR B:.",
            "summary_en": "The EC1045 system (Petr Všijanský): CP/M from the ZRMD-1 RAM disk and the FDC-1 controller with PC floppies, 3.5\" and 5.25\" HD. After power on press 1 (3.5\") or 2 (5.25\", insert the disk in the Media window), then DIR B:."
        },
        "libor_doma.sapi": {
            "title_en": "Libor at home (ImBUS12: JPR-1V, RAM-1V, AND-1V, DSM-1V, ZRD-1V, DGD-1V, CGA-1V, MPH-1V)",
            "summary": "Sestava Libora Lasoty doma na sběrnici ImBUS12 s jeho deskami V: textový displej AND-1V, grafiky DGD-1V a CGA-1V (střídají se podle MAP), myš MPH-1V a RAM disk ZRD-1V. Po zapnutí stiskněte 3 (CP/M z RAM disku), pak DIR. Disky B: a C: bez desky IDE-1 nefungují.",
            "summary_en": "Libor Lasota's set at home on the ImBUS12 bus with his V boards: the AND-1V text display, the DGD-1V and CGA-1V graphics (switched by MAP), the MPH-1V mouse and the ZRD-1V RAM disk. After power on press 3 (CP/M from the RAM disk), then DIR. The disks B: and C: do not work without the IDE-1 board."
        },
